theorem `circulant_mul` / 定理 `circulant_mul`

English:
theorem circulant_mul
  given: [NonUnitalNonAssocSemiring α] [Fintype n] [AddGroup n] (v w : n -> α)
  proof: by
  ext i j
  simp only [mul_apply, mulVec, circulant_apply, dotProduct]
  refine Fintype.sum_equiv (Equiv.subRight j) _ _ ?_
  intro x
  simp only [Equiv.subRight_apply, sub_sub_sub_cancel_right]

中文:
定理 circulant_mul
  条件: [非幺非结合半环 α] [有限类型 n] [加法群 n] (v w : n -> α)
  证明: by
  ext i j
  simp only [mul_apply, mulVec, circulant_apply, dotProduct]
  refine Fintype.sum_equiv (Equiv.subRight j) _ _ ?_
  intro x
  simp only [Equiv.subRight_apply, sub_sub_sub_cancel_right]

Depends on / 依赖: Equiv.subRight, Equiv.subRight_apply, Fintype, Fintype.sum_equiv, circulant_apply, dotProduct, mulVec, mul_apply, subRight, subRight_apply, sub_sub_sub_cancel_right, sum_equiv
-/
theorem circulant_mul [NonUnitalNonAssocSemiring α] [Fintype n] [AddGroup n] (v w : n -> α) :
    circulant v * circulant w = circulant (circulant v *ᵥ w) := by
  ext i j
  simp only [mul_apply, mulVec, circulant_apply, dotProduct]
  refine Fintype.sum_equiv (Equiv.subRight j) _ _ ?_
  intro x
  simp only [Equiv.subRight_apply, sub_sub_sub_cancel_right]

